/-!
# Marked full-flag rings at one adjoint site: declaration and axiom audit

**Status.** The total dimensions of the three marked full-flag rings are Lean theorems, for all
parameters `B ≥ 2k`. With `c(B, k) = #(paired configurations of B roots with k doubles) = B!/2^k`
(`fullFlagConfiguration_card_closed`), a marked group `V` of size `q` and a first group of size
`p`:

* singly marked ring on `B + 1` roots (first group unmarked, cutoff `B - k` on it):
  `dim = q · c(B, k)` (`singlyMarkedFlag_finrank_eq`);
* doubly marked ring on `B + 2` roots: `dim = p · q · c(B, k)` (`doublyMarkedFlag_finrank_eq`);
* weak ring on `B + 1` roots, `k ≥ 1`:
  `dim ≤ p q c(B-1, k-1) + q C(q-1, 2) c(B-2, k-1)` (`weakMarkedFlag_finrank_le`), with equality
  when both groups are nonempty (`weakMarkedFlag_finrank_eq`);
* the ideal generated by the product of the unmarked roots of a singly marked ring with `k ≥ 1`
  has dimension at least `q C(q-1, 2) c(B-2, k-1)`
  (`singlyMarkedFlag_unmarkedProduct_finrank_ge`);
* the layer maps of an unmarked root of the singly marked ring are isomorphisms
  (`singlyMarkedLayerMap_injective_same`, `singlyMarkedLayerMap_injective_lower`), and every layer
  bound of a first-group root of the doubly marked ring with `k ≥ 1` is attained
  (`doublyMarkedLayer_finrank_eq_bound`);
* the top-coefficient identity behind the omitted-point stratum: for a coinvariant alphabet,
  a group `V` with `∏ V = 0` and `u ∉ V`,
  `(-1)^|U'| ∏ U' · c_(|V|-1)(V) = u^(|U'| + |V| - 1)` with `U' = Vᶜ ∖ {u}`
  (`coinvariant_product_topCoefficient`).

The generic tools are: the marked full-flag ideal and its universal property
(`markedFlagIdeal`, `markedFlagIdeal_le_ker`); complementary-alphabet vanishing of two-root
complete functions and the cutoff exchanges (`pairComplete_vanish`,
`pair_boundary_mem_of_product`, `pair_boundary_mem_of_card`, `pair_middle_zero_of_card`,
`powerSum_boundary_mem`, `firstGroup_powerSum_exchange`, `firstGroup_power_product_zero`); layer
rings of a deleted root with their child presentations (`deletedLayer_finrank_le`,
`deletedLayer_markedFlagIdeal_le_ker`, `deletedLayerMap`); and the lower bound for a subspace
from the power filtration of a nilpotent element (`layer_finrank_sum_le`).

**Not proved here.** `OneAdjointStratumCount B 1` remains open. The remaining nodes are:

* the stratum lower bounds at `k = 1` on the full flags (explicit stratum ideals in complement
  form; the omitted-point, singly marked, product-stratum, omitted-zero, doubly marked
  `k = 0`, weak and doubly marked `j = 1, 2` strata);
* the deformation lower bounds for the stratum quotients (minors vanish on configurations with
  fewer than `j` doubles inside `Y`);
* exact layers of the weak ring and of the doubly marked ring at `k = 0`;
* Reynolds descent from the full flags to the coefficient ring
  `AdjointSiteCoefficientRing (mixedLabelBlockParams 1 B d e₁ e₂) (B - 1)`, the identification of
  the descended stratum ideals with `adjointSiteJointTopIdeal`, and the orbit count
  `adjointSiteWordCount`.

Axiom check: of the
169 declarations printed below, 165 depend on exactly `[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]`;
`singlyMarkedCutoff` and `mem_span_pow_succ_of_le` depend on `[propext, Quot.sound]`, and
`mul_mem_of_eq_zero` and `ideal_mem_of_eq_zero` on no axioms. No `sorry`, `admit`,
`native_decide`, `push_neg` or additional axiom is used.
-/
